        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Tudor Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes, this Omnia made handleset with oval mounts is made of tough, non-rusting materials. The delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door levers, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/oval-plate-mortise-lockset-omnia-26858\"><b>Matching Lockset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" heigth=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Demensions\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Tudor Entry Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 1-1/4\" wide with a 1-1/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Tudor Handlseset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-3/4\" door thickness standard.</li>\r\n<li>Available with either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>When Selecting a Function</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Standard:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece. Deadbolt activated only by key on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p><i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tudor Entrance Handleset Omnia",
